  "definition": "Net Energy Metering",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.13) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.16); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.17)",
